      "description": "The methodologies this layer adopts from its own library: external, named methods for formalising mathematics in Lean. Separate from `cat-harness/methodologies/` for the reason `core-methodologies` is separate from both -- a method belongs to the layer whose job it describes, so this directory lifts out with this instance and nothing else moves (`methodology-adoption` §4). Each node renders the METHOD and states where the rendering stops; the paper's tools and numbers are not adopted. Bean h3rw.",
